823-0XTjZ0Rtm7va.jpg"}]}],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-12","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":12},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"2709|1|12"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Episodio 1","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"46942","synopsis":"Dowa kingdom is comprised of thirteen autonomous districts. Their peace is maintained by a single massive organization, ACCA. Deputy Chief Jean Otus of ACCA Headquarters Inspection Department is in charge of conducting ad hoc audits of the thirteen district branches. As he is about to head to Famasu District, however, ACCA's Five Chief Officers announce that the Inspection Department is to be shut down due to its perceived obsolescence in peaceful times...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oN4nIWXukm5x4bpFia2QrUhU3gk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Dowa kingdom is comprised of thirteen autonomous districts. Their peace is maintained by a single massive organization, ACCA. Deputy Chief Jean Otus of ACCA Headquarters Inspection Department is in charge of conducting ad hoc audits of the thirteen district branches. As he is about to head to Famasu District, however, ACCA's Five Chief Officers announce that the Inspection Department is to be shut down due to its perceived obsolescence in peaceful times...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oN4nIWXukm5x4bpFia2QrUhU3gk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"46943","synopsis":"Constable Rail, the rookie agent of ACCA's Badon branch, has a profound dislike for elite agents in ACCA headquarters and has it out for Jean. Meanwhile, feeling watched, Jean asks for his friend Nino's help. With rumors of a coup d'état circulating among the upper echelons of ACCA's hierarchy, Chief Officer Grossular announces at the Five Chief Officers meeting that he has obtained credible information about the coup.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/369hBAqoUO57FErBE0pwv1jiptn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Constable Rail, the rookie agent of ACCA's Badon branch, has a profound dislike for elite agents in ACCA headquarters and has it out for Jean. Meanwhile, feeling watched, Jean asks for his friend Nino's help. With rumors of a coup d'état circulating among the upper echelons of ACCA's hierarchy, Chief Officer Grossular announces at the Five Chief Officers meeting that he has obtained credible information about the coup.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/369hBAqoUO57FErBE0pwv1jiptn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"46944","synopsis":"Director-General Mauve of ACCA headquarters invites Jean out to dinner, where she asks him for his aid in gathering more information about a brewing coup d'état. Meanwhile, rumors of a coup had reached even the Dowan royal family. With Prince Schwan's coming of age commemorative ceremony in the works, the Five Chief Officers receive a request to attend the ceremony, as well as Jean as a representative of the Inspection Department.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fkjytAoYtlCJtHoiEcDLBHaqYuj.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Director-General Mauve of ACCA headquarters invites Jean out to dinner, where she asks him for his aid in gathering more information about a brewing coup d'état. Meanwhile, rumors of a coup had reached even the Dowan royal family. With Prince Schwan's coming of age commemorative ceremony in the works, the Five Chief Officers receive a request to attend the ceremony, as well as Jean as a representative of the Inspection Department.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fkjytAoYtlCJtHoiEcDLBHaqYuj.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"46945","synopsis":"Jean has come to Suitsu District to do an audit. In Suitsu, excessive safeguards to uphold tradition and formality have restricted the exchange of goods and ideas between district residents and the outside world. Their isolation could be felt even by Jean, who then runs into residents discussing a coup by accident. Fearing disclosure, they kidnap Jean. Jean is about to learn a lot more about Suitsu residents and their opinions...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2s9JtMVAVBuAyBfyjLFosZYjVXV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Jean has come to Suitsu District to do an audit. In Suitsu, excessive safeguards to uphold tradition and formality have restricted the exchange of goods and ideas between district residents and the outside world. Their isolation could be felt even by Jean, who then runs into residents discussing a coup by accident. Fearing disclosure, they kidnap Jean. Jean is about to learn a lot more about Suitsu residents and their opinions...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2s9JtMVAVBuAyBfyjLFosZYjVXV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"46946","synopsis":"Back from his Suitsu audit, Jean asks his supervisor, Owl, about the status of his transfer request. Unfortunately, it seems unlikely to be approved anytime soon. As Jean leaves to go home, Chief Officer Lilium offers him a ride, where he tells Jean that he is being watched. Jean soon leaves for Birra District for yet another audit, where he comes to learn a troubling truth...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pdMtuuatqG4PfMXPtdUYGMMxAZG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Back from his Suitsu audit, Jean asks his supervisor, Owl, about the status of his transfer request. Unfortunately, it seems unlikely to be approved anytime soon. As Jean leaves to go home, Chief Officer Lilium offers him a ride, where he tells Jean that he is being watched. Jean soon leaves for Birra District for yet another audit, where he comes to learn a troubling truth...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pdMtuuatqG4PfMXPtdUYGMMxAZG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"46947","synopsis":"In Rokkusu District for an audit, Jean finds Grossular visiting his homeland. Jean has an honest conversation with Grossular about his thoughts on the coup rumors before he departs. Back in Badon, the Inspection Department staff are abuzz with plans to celebrate the coming new year. Eventually, they decide to go to the party held at Jean's apartment complex. Jean welcomes the new year surrounded by his colleagues.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ko9DUMCXIWzSLLrNelHFlfl5Oyl.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"In Rokkusu District for an audit, Jean finds Grossular visiting his homeland. Jean has an honest conversation with Grossular about his thoughts on the coup rumors before he departs. Back in Badon, the Inspection Department staff are abuzz with plans to celebrate the coming new year. Eventually, they decide to go to the party held at Jean's apartment complex. Jean welcomes the new year surrounded by his colleagues.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ko9DUMCXIWzSLLrNelHFlfl5Oyl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"46948","synopsis":"Jean's next destination happens to be Dowa District, where the royal house resides. Jean is deep in thought about the coup rumors in which he has become inextricably entwined, but there are too many variables for him to make sense of where things may be headed. Jean goes out into the city to buy Lotta presents, but it so happens that the king is also having his outing in the city, and there are many guards out on the road...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6T5s0j4qVM2dmvfk9IBnUfOB4ef.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Jean's next destination happens to be Dowa District, where the royal house resides. Jean is deep in thought about the coup rumors in which he has become inextricably entwined, but there are too many variables for him to make sense of where things may be headed. Jean goes out into the city to buy Lotta presents, but it so happens that the king is also having his outing in the city, and there are many guards out on the road...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6T5s0j4qVM2dmvfk9IBnUfOB4ef.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"46949","synopsis":"The time has come for Nino to tell Jean everything. He begins the very long tale by going 33 years back into the past, with the royal family involved...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ksgIL5Phv5j3ve3Q83q48JPnbiQ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"The time has come for Nino to tell Jean everything. He begins the very long tale by going 33 years back into the past, with the royal family involved...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ksgIL5Phv5j3ve3Q83q48JPnbiQ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12136","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21823","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33337","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69225","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319983","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"46950","synopsis":"While Jean is away on an extended trip to audit three districts in a row, there are signs of unrest that begin to close in on Lotta. Magie contacts Rail that Lotta is in danger upon learning of the events set in motion. Rail acts to protect Lotta, but the shadowy figures draw ever closer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsGOYZofQbLf1u9R8g1BfH5MFOF.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"While Jean is away on an extended trip to audit three districts in a row, there are signs of unrest that begin to close in on Lotta. Magie contacts Rail that Lotta is in danger upon learning of the events set in motion. Rail acts to protect Lotta, but the shadowy figures draw ever closer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsGOYZofQbLf1u9R8g1BfH5MFOF.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id"